data: {"id": "be41073128674096-final", "run_id": "be41073128674096", "seq": 1351, "ts_ms": 1788422499129, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中的 key `unavailable-key`，但该 Secret 中实际只存在 key `available-key`，导致 Kubelet 无法创建容器配置。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `kubectl get` | `container.waiting_reason=CreateContainerConfigError`, `container.waiting_message=\"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\"` (fact-33cc8300f966, fact-67e3f354016d) | 直接确认 Kubelet 无法创建容器配置的原因是 Secret Key 缺失。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubectl get events` | `Warning Failed ... kubelet Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (fact-b23d7167959a, fact-d3524caa5d1f) | 提供 Kubelet 侧重复报错记录，证实故障发生在容器启动前阶段。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `kubectl get pods` | `pod.phase=Pending`, `ContainersReady=False`, `Ready=False` (fact-219384e6efed, fact-255aff316f61, fact-a59cc450b377) | 描述 Pod 处于不可用状态的系统级现象。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` (fact-f4eb6c11549c) | 跨维度确认当前等待原因为配置错误。 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1`, `kube_pod_container_status_ready = 0` (fact-a44124b7e703, fact-3d311b9ef041) | 量化反映 Pod 持续处于 Pending 且未就绪的状态。 |\n\n**证据印证关系：**\nK8s State 与 Event 中明确的 `CreateContainerConfigError` 和 `couldn't find key unavailable-key` 原始错误信息，与 Prometheus 中统计到的 `waiting_reason=CreateContainerConfigError` 相互印证，确认故障根因并非资源不足或网络问题，而是启动前配置查找失败。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用了不存在的 Secret key \"unavailable-key\" (事实支撑) → Kubelet 无法解析并挂载配置 → 容器无法创建/启动 (CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 在其容器配置中引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中的 key `unavailable-key`，但目标 Secret 中并不存在该 key（实际仅存在 `available-key`）。\n\n**支持事实**：\n1.  **K8s State/Event** 明确指出容器因找不到指定 Secret key 而报错，直接触发 `CreateContainerConfigError` (证据 1, 2)。\n2.  **Metric** 独立验证了该 Pod 正处于配置错误导致的等待状态 (证据 4)。\n\n现有证据已形成闭环，确认为配置引用错误。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 63.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 63.6s (Evidence 54.6s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 93.085, "metrics": {"run_id": "be41073128674096", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 93.09460401535034, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 93094.60401535034, "llm_calls": 24, "llm_duration_ms": 85118.15428733826, "tool_calls": 26, "executed_tool_calls": 23, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 11981.978416442871, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 7371.648788452148}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18470.580339431763, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 63553.10678482056, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11042.120456695557, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

